sequenceDiagram
    participant Leader as Leader Pod
    participant Follower as Follower Pod
    participant API as REST API
    participant LB as Load Balancer
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over Leader, Follower: Normal Operation
    Leader->>Leader: scheduler.becomeLeader()
    Leader->>Leader: tick() every 2s
    Note over Leader: heartbeat every 10s
    Leader->>DB: update lease

    alt Leader Heartbeat Timeout (>30s)
        Note over Follower: leader death detected
        Follower->>Follower: isLeaderAlive() = false
        Follower->>Follower: becomeLeader()
        Follower->>Follower: start ticking
        Follower->>DB: acquire lease
        Note over Follower: workflows continue from in-memory state
    end

    alt Pod Crash
        Note over API: Load balancer routes to remaining pod
        API->>LB: request
        LB->>Follower: route to healthy pod
        Note over Follower: new leader starts workflows
    end

    alt Region Failure
        Note over API: DNS failover to DR region
        API->>API: control plane starts in DR region
        API->>API: restore from checkpoint
        API->>API: resume CDC from last offset
    end
